Model weights and model code
----------------------------
The weights are a distilled student of nvidia/NVIDIA-NemotronLabs-RE-USE (revision
31f82f2efad1095034492f236e8dac9239ba713b). The encoder, decoders and the starting TFMamba blocks
were copied from that checkpoint and then trained further against its outputs.
