Training data
-------------
VoiceBank-DEMAND (Valentini-Botinhao et al., University of Edinburgh), CC BY 4.0, used through
https://huggingface.co/datasets/JacobLinCool/VoiceBank-DEMAND-16k. Not redistributed except the
short before/after samples in samples/, which are taken from its test set.
